    <Description>Explicit local TVM storage, mandatory shared private records and capability-aware bounded identity CQL. Native save/load/process reopen/query controls pass. Mongo/browser demo, signed public-network transport, NFT/wallet, CAS and full HyperDrive parity are not certified. See the provider README for current evidence.</Description>
